## 🔍 Critical WFRP 4e Data Structures

### Characteristics Path
```javascript
actor.system.characteristics = {
  ws: { initial: 30, advances: 5, modifier: 0, value: 35, bonus: 3 },
  bs: { initial: 25, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 25, bonus: 2 },
  s:  { initial: 35, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 35, bonus: 3 },
  t:  { initial: 30, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 30, bonus: 3 },
  i:  { initial: 25, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 25, bonus: 2 },
  ag: { initial: 30, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 30, bonus: 3 },
  dex:{ initial: 30, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 30, bonus: 3 },
  int:{ initial: 25, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 25, bonus: 2 },
  wp: { initial: 30, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 30, bonus: 3 },
  fel:{ initial: 25, advances: 0, modifier: 0, value: 25, bonus: 2 }
}
```

**Key Fields**:
- `initial` - Base value before advances
- `advances` - Number of times advanced (costs XP)
- `modifier` - Temporary modifiers (items, effects)
- `value` - Calculated: initial + advances + modifier
- `bonus` - Tens digit of value (auto-calculated)

### Status Values Path
```javascript
actor.system.status = {
  wounds: {
    value: 15,      // Current wounds
    max: 16         // Maximum wounds
  },
  fortune: {
    value: 3,       // Current Fortune points
    max: 4          // Maximum (equals Fate)
  },
  fate: {
    value: 4,       // Current Fate points
    max: 4          // Maximum Fate
  },
  resilience: {
    value: 2,       // NPC equivalent of Fate
    max: 2
  },
  resolve: {
    value: 2,       // NPC equivalent of Fortune
    max: 2
  },
  corruption: {
    value: 0        // Corruption points
  }
}
```

### XP Structure
```javascript
actor.system.details.experience = {
  current: 1500,   // Available XP
  total: 2000,     // Total XP earned
  spent: 500       // XP spent on advances
}
```

### Career Structure (Embedded Document)
```javascript
// Career is an Item embedded in Actor
actor.items.find(i => i.type === 'career' && i.system.current.value === true)

// Career item structure
{
  name: "Soldier",
  type: "career",
  system: {
    current: { value: true },  // Is this the active career?
    level: { value: 2 },       // Career level
    status: { tier: "Silver", standing: 3 },
    careergroup: { value: "Warriors" },
    class: "Warrior"
  }
}
```

### Skills (Embedded Documents)
```javascript
// Skills are Items embedded in Actor
actor.items.filter(i => i.type === 'skill')

// Skill item structure
{
  name: "Melee (Basic)",
  type: "skill",
  system: {
    advances: { value: 10 },     // Number of advances
    characteristic: { value: "ws" }, // Linked characteristic
    total: { value: 40 }         // Calculated: char value + advances
  }
}
```

### Talents (Embedded Documents)
```javascript
// Talents are Items embedded in Actor
actor.items.filter(i => i.type === 'talent')

// Talent item structure
{
  name: "Combat Reflexes",
  type: "talent",
  system: {
    advances: { value: 1 },      // Talent rank/times taken
    tests: { value: "+10 Initiative" }
  }
}
```

