After diagnosing, update `test/test_result.md`:

```markdown
### Test Case X.Y: Test Name
**Date**: 2026-01-24
**Status**: ❌ FAIL / ✅ PASS

**Expected**: [What should happen]
**Actual**: [What actually happened]

**Issue**: [Root cause]
**Fix Applied**: [Code changes made]
**Reference**: [Foundry API doc or WFRP system file]

**Retest Required**: Yes/No
**Notes**: [Additional context]
```

