→ Follow Tool Implementation Patterns section, create tool file, register in backend.ts, add handler in queries.ts

### "Fix [issue]"
→ Use Diagnostic Workflow, reference Foundry docs, check WFRP system, propose fix

### "Build is failing"
→ Check TypeScript errors, verify imports, check tsconfig.json

