### Common Mistakes

❌ **WRONG**: Editing files in worktree
```bash
# Bad - you're in the worktree
C:\Users\danil0\.claude-worktrees\warhammer-mcp\compassionate-montalcini\packages\mcp-server\src\tools\character.ts
```

✅ **CORRECT**: Editing files in main repository
```bash
# Good - you're in the main repository
/d/foundry-vtt-mcp/packages/mcp-server/src/tools/character.ts
```

### Quick Fix

If you realize you're in the wrong place:
```bash
# Navigate to main repository
cd /d/foundry-vtt-mcp

# Verify
pwd
# Should show: /d/foundry-vtt-mcp
```

